      "text": "Beats 3 and 5. T-028.\nSubmits a business request: intent, cost ceiling,\ndata classification. Exposes classification as a\ncontrol — it is a property of the REQUEST, not a\nrouting preference, so it stays inside Principle IV.",
      "originalText": "Beats 3 and 5. T-028.\nSubmits a business request: intent, cost ceiling,\ndata classification. Exposes classification as a\ncontrol — it is a property of the REQUEST, not a\nrouting preference, so it stays inside Principle IV.",
