      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Beat 4. T-031.\n500+ alerts, virtualised list (500 DOM rows stutter on\nprojector hardware and the stutter reads as \"this does\nnot scale\"). Sorts default to model rank, because the\nranking IS the product. A visible seed indicator carries\nthe AC-6 reproducibility claim.",
      "originalText": "Beat 4. T-031.\n500+ alerts, virtualised list (500 DOM rows stutter on\nprojector hardware and the stutter reads as \"this does\nnot scale\"). Sorts default to model rank, because the\nranking IS the product. A visible seed indicator carries\nthe AC-6 reproducibility claim.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
