      "text": "Beat 5. No task number: this screen does not exist in\nthe current task list, and Beat 5 cannot run without it.\nThe vendor toggle has to live in the product — doing it\nin the Azure portal breaks the claim that governance is\na first-class surface. Read-mostly with a single vendor\ntoggle is enough.",
